# SkipLogo: OFF (fixtures/skiplogooff, the CD's LBA.CFG with the key
# off). Escape in the logo's white fade, at skipwhite's time, leaves the
# logo whole as in 1994: its white fade, its fade from white and its
# 4 s pause, then the bumper.

sleep 2
key Escape
sleep 1
shot white
sleep 3
shot logo
sleep 6
shot bumper
